                  <content styleCode="bold">HOW SUPPLIED:</content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>3 oz. (85 g) bottles, <content styleCode="bold">NDC</content> 85622-0605-03</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <br/>
                     <content styleCode="bold">To report </content>a serious adverse event or obtain product information, call (813) 380-0271.</paragraph>
